  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rescue, Rehab and Re-home Street Dogs in Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">We get hundreds of calls each week from people attacking dogs with acid to others grooming dogs to fight. The situation we face is real and it is expensive but we never leave a god alone. Our team are out rescuing these puppies as well as providing a weekly service in a township where we provide vaccinations and help manage breeding through our neutering program. We fund this project 100% through donations, you are the people saving these puppies!</narrative>
  </description>
